    title: "Java/Kotlin/js_ts analyzers and the core inheritance linker (C#, C++, Go, Groovy, Scala, PHP) bind a base imported from an external package, or written qualified, to an in-repo class of the same simple name (non-Python sibling of WI-ratid)"  # e7b8
